dodo-session (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Every monitor has desktops of its own, created as needed and named by
    position (labwc <desktops perOutput dynamic>, Dodobian patch 0004).
  * The pinned= monitor of session.conf is gone with its login-time labwc
    layer and the split panel: a monitor keeps its desktop while another one
    switches. An old pinned= key is ignored, and the log says so.

